WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:09.000
<v Ana Silva>Retro for the Redis cutover. Overall it went fine, about four minutes of elevated latency.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:20.000
<v Ben Cho>The latency came from cold caches in billing. We should have pre-warmed the keys.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
<v Carla Diaz>The new dashboard caught it right away, the hit rate dropped to forty percent.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:44.000
<v Ana Silva>Agreed, next time we pre-warm. We have agreed to add a warmup job to the cutover checklist.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:55.000
<v Ben Cho>I'll write the warmup script by next Friday.
